// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_HUSTLENIGHT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1318443136" "Carpe diem!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_HUSTLENIGHT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3275411474" "Seize the day!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_HUSTLENIGHT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P890471264" "Now!"

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1944124635" "You break out of a building with loot in your hand and you think no one is going to notice?"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1623037173" "Right.  I'll take that.  You won't be needing it."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1596225390" "Marconeville used to be such a nice town."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1972601211" "What do you think you're doing?"

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2507293010" "Arachnos does not tolerate interlopers!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3523604546" "You try to oppose Arachnos?"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1186675437" "Arachnos will NOT be challenged!"

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4150377227" "I didn't do what you think I did!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1779540427" "The Family doesn't squeal for anybody."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1202600465" "This won't be forgotten, Arachnos.  I don't care WHO your boss is."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1353150170" "The Family has a long memory.  You better hope I don't survive this."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4285879122" "Oh, this is such a big mistake.  The Family doesn't squawk for no one."

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3544174739" "You can run, but you cannot hide!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1266477646" "Follow the blood trail!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P756122143" "This will be an easy catch. He's wounded."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2220178741" "This is almost too easy.  Follow the blood trail."

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P326452411" "Do not interfere with Arachnos!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2608796782" "You stepped into the wrong web, fly."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1871713513" "More prey."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1790205471" "Ah look.  More sport.  Take them out, too."

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTCHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2462083797" "Stop it.  We cannot let this opportunity pass!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTCHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2856499864" "Don't let it get away!  We need it for research!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTCHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P822352349" "Follow it!  Do not let it get away!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTCHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1892863833" "Catch it and bring it up to the device!"

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTCHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3814451947" "This is not your place to interfere!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTCHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P605745151" "You cannot live to reveal anything."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTCHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1919440125" "Take care of them.  We cannot afford this opportunity to slip through our fingers!"

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_BANKGUARD_TEXT :
"P727732960" "No funny stuff inside."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_BANKGUARD_TEXT :
"P1311713012" "I will shoot you if you get out of hand."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_BANKGUARD_TEXT :
"P2139644545" "Don't give me a reason to unload on you."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_BANKGUARD_TEXT :
"P1641661386" "I have twitchy fingers.  Keep it clean in there."

// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3033243065" "Sir, a few stragglers, but other than that nothing to worry about."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2559827602" "Yes, sir, we've got it under control here."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P251107897" "This part of Oil Spill is clear, sir."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3854017597" "Ray, quit fooling around.  Get off the air."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3305756938" "Look.  You watch your bit.  I'll watch mine.  Sorry, sir, that was not for you."

// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3768250182" "Attack!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P177223314" "Protect the shipment!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P813224250" "Incoming!  Over and out, sir!"

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GUARDFORT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1820334139" "There's rumblings of activity down there."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GUARDFORT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P932951181" "Nothing to worry about.  The turrets will get them."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GUARDFORT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2909285248" "The fort is secure.  No one will get in."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GUARDFORT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3742747381" "Look over there a bit.  See anything?"

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GUARDFORT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3878142455" "Protect the Fort!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GUARDFORT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3724648888" "Keep the Fort secure!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GUARDFORT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3521260717" "Men!  Keep them out of the Fort!"

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTFIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3002467012" "Don't you even realize you're DEAD?"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTFIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3720252207" "You had your time!  This is our Fort now!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTFIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1124699831" "Go to the light already!"

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTFIGHT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4187198456" "You don't belong here either!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTFIGHT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P231361154" "Do you want to die, too?"

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTFIGHT_GHOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3616741911" "Have at ye, ye landlubber!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTFIGHT_GHOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1408880593" "Mateys, the Fort be ours!  Protect it!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTFIGHT_GHOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P110580908" "You'll be seein' Davy Jones' locker soon enough, ye land lubber!"

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTFIGHT_GHOST_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2122648639" "Walk the plank, ye scurvy cur!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTFIGHT_GHOST_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2368594617" "Have at ye!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTFIGHT_GHOST_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2387477557" "We not be done yet, mateys!  More a'comin'!"

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_GHOSTTRAP_FLEEINGTRAPPEDGHOST_TEXT :
"P4037937440" "Ye haven't see the last of me!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_GHOSTTRAP_FLEEINGTRAPPEDGHOST_TEXT :
"P1811756705" "I be cursed. 'Tis a curse, fer certain!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_GHOSTTRAP_FLEEINGTRAPPEDGHOST_TEXT :
"P1902127460" "Tis no dishonor in a hasty retreat!"

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_GHOSTTRAP_INSPECTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1918950478" "Is this what I think it is?"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_GHOSTTRAP_INSPECTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4120762782" "Wow, I didn't know the traps were working."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_GHOSTTRAP_INSPECTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P627424307" "Interesting.  I can only imagine the possibilities."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_GHOSTTRAP_INSPECTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1480457970" "Wow.  Is that a ghost?"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_GHOSTTRAP_INSPECTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P297104705" "How long will the trap be able to contain?"

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_GHOSTTRAP_INSPECTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3734156081" "Watch it!  You disengaged the trap!  He's loose!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_GHOSTTRAP_INSPECTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1064033791" "He's loose!  It's YOUR fault!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_GHOSTTRAP_INSPECTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1995938228" "Interfering with Arachnos research is a deadly mistake!"

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1233883949" "Maintain strength, men, both mind and body."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2810721616" "The fitter you are, the more trained, the better soldier you will be."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P241415531" "We're not alone on this island.  Mistakes are a luxury we cannot afford."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3398766762" "Old age and treachery, men.  I'll pass it on to you."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P433824936" "I've taught you what you know.  I haven't taught you what I know."

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P340109665" "Heroes!  Protect the Fort!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P334631850" "Do NOT let them in here!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P278895057" "You know what to do, men!"

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1011674359" "Faster!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4274575296" "More precision, men!  This isn't a dance party!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1826008453" "Clean it up!  I want perfection!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2120922159" "You are the best!  You are Arachnos!  Do not let me down!"

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_DRILLYELL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3868978757" "This is not a drill!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_DRILLYELL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3367810579" "You wanted some action?  You got it!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_DRILLYELL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1236270181" "Here's your first test!  Take 'em out!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_DRILLYELL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2685544561" "Lesson's over!  Here's the test!"

// OAKES_OILSPILL_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2615898304" "Easy, soldier.  We don't want any damage to the shipment."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1292962553" "Just move it over there."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3827956695" "Take it easy.  This shipment is important."

// OAKES_OILSPILL_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1693321479" "No one touches this shipment!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4095292152" "You know the orders!  No one gets near the shipment!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P772934975" "You have your orders!  Take 'em out!"

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P444583680" "What do you think?  Haunted?  Not haunted?"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2589743244" "I'm not afraid of a few ghosts."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2085062720" "See the Thorns over there?  They'll never make it in."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P737448152" "We've been walking this same patrol for hours."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P861387199" "Hey, wait up!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2527099406" "I don't know what patrol you're on, but we're going this way."

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2027915350" "Just maintain order.  Keep walking."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1924627378" "Maintain an Arachnos presence.  Keep walking."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2431508784" "Marconeville needs a strong Arachnos presence."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P257888559" "Are we almost done?  I need a break."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2206735098" "My dogs are barkin' here.  How much longer?"

// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2156050743" "I wanted the Marconeville patrol.  I got Oil Spill.  Nice."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3077678511" "If I see one more oil slick I'm going to freak."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P715258891" "Oil Spill is a hole.  I wanted Fort duty."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1794705212" "Freaks, Family, and Council.  Nothing new here, boys."

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_WARMUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1768422100" "Stretch.  Keep limber.  Your body must be well honed."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_WARMUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1397062465" "The more limber you are, the better you'll fight."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_WARMUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3022254150" "This Fort deserves its men to be well trained."

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_WARMUP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3096967322" "Time for some real-time calisthenics!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_WARMUP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P676851466" "Aren't you glad you warmed up, boys?"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_WARMUP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P31444497" "And now...we fight!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_WARMUP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3404268449" "You're gonna learn about loss!"

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_WATCHTOWER_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1802874195" "We're clear here.  Over."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_WATCHTOWER_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P476017468" "Nothing the guys on the ground can't handle."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_WATCHTOWER_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2105596284" "Marconeville looks pretty sweet from up here."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_WATCHTOWER_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1672568210" "Ever notice how people look like ants when you're high up?"

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_WATCHTOWER_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P652360327" "Incoming, sir!  Over and out!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_WATCHTOWER_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2260604058" "We got unfriendlies!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_WATCHTOWER_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1564094541" "Get backup in position!"

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_FISHTRAP_FLEEINGTRAPPEDFISH_TEXT :
"P2067480586" "Your stupidity will not go unrewarded!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_FISHTRAP_FLEEINGTRAPPEDFISH_TEXT :
"P4266906237" "This is not over!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_FISHTRAP_FLEEINGTRAPPEDFISH_TEXT :
"P1065537703" "The Coralax are not done here!"

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_FISHTRAP_INSPECTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1526399508" "And I didn't even use a hook."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_FISHTRAP_INSPECTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3198120652" "This thing is too big to throw back."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_FISHTRAP_INSPECTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P467248480" "What the heck is this?"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_FISHTRAP_INSPECTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2491184181" "Ugh!  What a smell!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_FISHTRAP_INSPECTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2826336019" "You have the right to remain unconscious.  Anything you say ain't gonna be much."

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_FISHTRAP_INSPECTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3872372021" "Secure the area!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_FISHTRAP_INSPECTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2027346304" "Don't let them get the specimen!"

// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_GUARDDOOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4260538087" "Brave move, dead hero!  Dumb, but brave!"
// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_GUARDDOOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1369909510" "Wow, trying to get in here?  Really REALLY stupid!"
// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_GUARDDOOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2124029873" "And we have some action!  Get the hero!"

// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P357083242" "We spotted some recon heroes earlier.  Keep a strong watch."
// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2208567163" "We're clear here.  How's your end?"
// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3822623087" "Say again?  My batteries are going.  Over."
// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2278178082" "They're insane if they think they can get into this base alive."
// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1940506114" "Never underestimate the enemy.  Keep those eyes peeled."

// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2416699406" "Unbelievable!  Let's do this!"
// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P140935697" "Sir!  We got heroes!  Over and out!"
// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1605366508" "Power up all the turrets, we have bogeys!"
// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2960877491" "Finally!  Some action.  Over and out!"

// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_ORDERS_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2933884408" "You can BET the hero base is heavily guarded.  We must be prepared."
// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_ORDERS_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P454697963" "There is no greater dishonor than having this base taken over by heroes."
// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_ORDERS_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1156828520" "There is no room for failure."
// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_ORDERS_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1530792482" "Failure is not an option."
// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_ORDERS_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3171924816" "Second place is not an option."
// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_ORDERS_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4085453701" "Keeping this base secure is your responsibility.  Removing your head, should heroes infiltrate, is mine."

// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_ORDERS_LEADER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3019564000" "You know what to do!"
// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_ORDERS_LEADER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3783148497" "This is not a drill!  No one gets in!"
// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_ORDERS_LEADER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2011186743" "No survivors!"

// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3147869362" "There is a turret every two feet.  Do we REALLY need to be walking this base?"
// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3565604140" "I'm getting tired.  My feet are killing me."
// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P897965898" "I asked for door guard duty.  I got patrol.  I see how it is."

// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1306571735" "Finally!  Some action!"
// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3919174316" "Shoot faster before the turrets take them out!"
// BLOODYBAY_SPIDERBASE_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2654555130" "Yes!  This beats walking!"

// BLOODYBAY_RECON_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P538060348" "The base is heavily guarded.  This could be interesting."
// BLOODYBAY_RECON_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1935799577" "It'll take more than a few men to get past their reinforcements."
// BLOODYBAY_RECON_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1454258208" "I'm going radio silent."
// BLOODYBAY_RECON_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3290764298" "Someone's close.  Radio silent."

// BLOODYBAY_RECON_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1970435342" "I've been spotted!"
// BLOODYBAY_RECON_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3694673474" "Blast!  Spotted!"
// BLOODYBAY_RECON_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3705993463" "It's go time!"

// BLOODYBAY_RECON_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3016765039" "Oh...whoa.  Yeah, they're pretty tight up there."
// BLOODYBAY_RECON_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2823055254" "Tell the base they're armed to the eye-teeth."
// BLOODYBAY_RECON_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2351594308" "Yeah, getting in there will be interesting."
// BLOODYBAY_RECON_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P83688573" "Whoa.  That's some serious presence they have."

// BLOODYBAY_RECON_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P266326471" "Uh...we have company."
// BLOODYBAY_RECON_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P458088774" "So much for stealthy recon."
// BLOODYBAY_RECON_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P825055665" "Stupid walkie talkie!  May as well have put a beacon over our heads!"
// BLOODYBAY_RECON_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
